            "review_title": "Review at 342 Lagoon",
            "review_text": "Lagisa\n6 contributions\n0\nDate night\nJan 2023 • Couples\nI went here with my boyfriend , this is a good restaurant , nice , beautiful, clean . I have a good recomend food from the owner and the staff was so friendly.the food here is fresh,yummy , tasty both of us love it . \nThe price was fair.cause im vietnamese so i knew the sefood from the sea with the price from the restaurant sell is cheaper compare with a lot of seafood restaurant around .\nHighly to recomend for all my foreign friend .\nWe will defunitely comeback soon\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 14, 2023\nTuyet\nThank you so much for your review and we hope to see you soon again for some more delicious seafood 🥳🐟🦞❤️🦐\nWritten January 15, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
